     * @param  ?string  $idempotencyKey  Repeat a request safely: SendSeven answers a repeat with the first result. One is generated when omitted.
     *
     * @throws ApiException
     *
     * @see https://api.sendseven.com/api/v1/docs#/Conversations/reopen_conversation_api_v1_conversations__conversation_id__reopen_post
